# Dual tariff with the rotation pin: off-peak starts (D11 LOW) without rotating, since rotation
# is on the pin; a press on D12 during off-peak rotates the priorities, as during peak
# (rotation_pin.scn). Priorities 0, 1, 2 (D5, D6, D7) become 2, 0, 1: D7 runs, D6 stays OFF.
# Before the press D5 runs and D6 takes the rest of the 1800 W, modulating (7 cycles ON of 9 at
# 60 Hz), so D6 is not checked at an instant: D5 ON and D7 OFF at 28 s show that the start of
# off-peak does not rotate.
include common.scn
duration 60

at 0   600 600 600
at 60  600 600 600

input 11 0 10           # off-peak starts, and lasts
input 12 0 30           # pressed
input 12 1 32           # released

expect 28 pin 5 on
expect 28 pin 7 off
expect 45 pin 7 on
expect 45 pin 6 off
